# Comma-separated list of origins allowed to call /api/scan from browser JS
# (e.g. your Shopify storefront). Needed for the Shopify embed to work — see
# SHOPIFY.md. Leave unset to block all cross-origin browser calls (server-to-
# server calls, and this app's own frontend, are unaffected either way).
#
# ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://mystore.com,https://mystore.myshopify.com
